    {
      "challengedBy": [],
      "claim": "In `checkIfIsAvailable`, the new working-hours gate computes `end` as `slotStartTime.hour() * 60 + slotStartTime.minute()` instead of using the slot end instant. Before this change, availability depended on the actual slot interval; after the change, any slot whose start is within working hours is treated as if its end were also at the same minute, so slots that extend past `workingHour.endTime` are no longer rejected correctly.",
